{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1000_p", "source_sha256": "229586feeb073d945d502c8849c15955ed928233baa749e59282fe42ae55d483", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のパジャマ特集の\n撮影だ。普段とは違う杏奈の可愛らしさが出てるな！）", "zh": "（是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣特辑拍摄。杏奈展现出了与平时不同的可爱一面啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "7a769893c33c9fa003d9d82b0c430128de725eb79b154791d308c5c8e75ce0e7", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n撮影……半分終わったけど……どうだった……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n拍摄……已经完成一半了……怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b6e74ee486fd130eeb448c39ef2fcac95144209dc3450bbedbfbda2cf061e7b0", "ja": "お疲れさま、杏奈。\nすごくいい感じに撮れてるよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。\n拍得非常棒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "2f9bf4659d5b44700cd52fafebb399915e8f24491569577fcc4cc658dc4bab52", "ja": "ほ、本当……？\n実は……杏奈、ちょっと心配で……。", "zh": "真、真的吗……？\n其实……杏奈，有点担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aa77f58a699f1feb8ff663f48070110cf08ac0d61b64b5f4c8b4b55d1a8e3e21", "ja": "心配？　なにか気になることでもあったのか？", "zh": "担心？是有什么在意的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "d092b7831548b8b7bf2546a0709bf6c1564f987a8a9db8d76b6116d3a71bccbf", "ja": "んと……前にやった、パジャマの撮影……。\nあの時は……いつも着てるのと、似てたから……。", "zh": "嗯……之前拍的，睡衣摄影……\n那个时候……因为和杏奈平时穿的很像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "458277036ccb4aa72afdf6a193a29a0da895292b5ea23358d1db7d139c5109a2", "ja": "お家にいるみたいで、のんびりできたけど……\n今日のパジャマは……その……。", "zh": "就像在家里一样，可以放松下来，不过今天的睡衣……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7354061ce75356987063ae240a47194ab3d6addf65a40ba0ce8a975cb2cfd8a7", "ja": "ああ。前より大人っぽい雰囲気だな。\nそのパジャマも、杏奈によく似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。感觉比之前更成熟了。\n那套睡衣也很适合杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "9ee54c4440ce08ec22e19b2b931a553a6b193eb669bb0369d221f71fb6ddd19c", "ja": "ありがと……です。でも、杏奈……\n寝る時に、こんなオシャレ、しないから……", "zh": "谢谢……你。不过，杏奈……\n睡觉的时候，从没穿过这么漂亮的衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "64e7e381c5f9103651e58c6c1d0c60ff81e9f3dd9919eba0b32ea22eb7ab8c28", "ja": "なんだか、ドキドキしちゃって……\n前より、リラックス……できてないかも、って……。", "zh": "总觉得……有点心跳加速……\n好像比起以前，反而没那么放松了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1010_p", "source_sha256": "38e12d80a9c7aec9f2ffdd7bc29a14f9eaa93e610dc799613118eff588a721df", "ja": "なるほど……。\nでも、それでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "原来如此……\n不过，这样不是挺好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "f2d010ed60524706b4e171203d5bc6f375abe388a603a445ac03e84d7b2f6db3", "ja": "……そう、なの……？", "zh": "……是，这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e59ca34f9ac0d593fe0a202dd0100bf5b06d89dc21521a787e21e940411e6371", "ja": "うん。誰にだって、リラックスして眠れる日もあれば、\nドキドキして眠れない日もあると思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得无论是谁，既会有能放松入睡的日子，\n也会有紧张兴奋到睡不着的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "98646cf306562a1f951591877e60ec87b0a8aeb917f5e198c910432ae43201b8", "ja": "ん。そうだね……。ライブの前の日とか……\n好きなゲームの発売日とか……杏奈も、そうかも……。", "zh": "嗯。也是呢……演唱会的前一天……\n或是喜欢的游戏发售日……杏奈可能也是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1014_p", "source_sha256": "821b38c896ebb82aec224a79db2abcab128351d51ef2e356070c322b572b0f30", "ja": "ああ。そういう、いい意味でのドキドキ感が、\n今日の杏奈から伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "嗯。今天的杏奈就传达出了那种，具有美好意义的心跳感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "d736c32a326f71efd869a0d9d3f84c0ccf8914c55708ff75c2341b6047610231", "ja": "あ……。そう、だったんだ……。\n杏奈……ドキドキしてて、よかったんだね……。", "zh": "啊……原来……是这样啊……\n杏奈……心跳加速，也是件好事呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0403_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "487fb16ba0a2b4d3318a81d7c124f3e896aec00998df64caad8815524c45304a", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとう……。\n杏奈、この気持ち……大切にするね……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你……。\n杏奈会……好好珍惜这份心情的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
